# Butler Routes - Tirisfal Glades rares and treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 12 rare-flagged NPCs of Tirisfal Glades
# (zone key 1420), verified against the local Forever game data
# (questie-forever npc/object/item dumps). Nine carry the data's rare
# role; three (Blightsculler, Decrepit Harvester, The Condemned One)
# are rank-4 elites with no rare role but exclusive named loot, and
# ship with that caveat stated (see
# docs/tirisfal-glades-companions-inventory.md). One rank-4 without
# loot (Coldrasp) is excluded. Every goal is optional - a missing
# spawn never wedges the guide. Multi-point rares loop all their
# points; single-point rares get plain single-goto steps. No tame
# lines ship (drop evidence but no same-species core kill; see
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Treasures ride two Battered Chest
# loops plus single-goto steps for the unique objects, all with
# contents-unconfirmed notes. No accept/turnin lines anywhere - the
# core guide owns every quest.
guide butler-routes-completionist/tirisfal-glades-rares
title Tirisfal Glades — Rares & Treasures
levels 1-13
zone Tirisfal Glades
faction Horde
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords tirisfal glades, rares, treasures, collectibles, companions
coords live
version 1

step West road - Bayne

  zone map 1420

  goto 39.9,42.16
  kill 10356 optional
  collect 283462 "Bayne's Bite" optional
  note Bayne (level 10 rare) holds a single point on the west road. Bayne's Bite drops here and nowhere else.
  note Also drops ordinary greens (wolf meat, rabbit feet); respawn timer unconfirmed.

